<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/resource/model__weibull_distribution> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#modelName> "Two-parameter Weibull distribution" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/resource/model__weibull_distribution> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#modelDescription> "A parametric probability distribution used to represent wind-speed frequency data." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/resource/model__weibull_distribution> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#distributionFormula> "f(v) = (k/c)(v/c)^(k-1) exp[-(v/c)^k]" .
