<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/resource/model__hierarchical_mixture_multiple_distributions> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#MixtureDistributionModel> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/resource/model__hierarchical_mixture_multiple_distributions> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#Model> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/resource/model__hierarchical_mixture_multiple_distributions> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#modelName> "Hierarchical mixture of multiple distributions" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/resource/model__hierarchical_mixture_multiple_distributions> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#modelDescription> "HMMD is a hierarchical mixture in which each outer component is approximated by an inner mixture model. In this study, four outer components were represented respectively by MoW, MoG, MoLN, and MoR" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/resource/model__hierarchical_mixture_multiple_distributions> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#modelDescription> "the number of distributions in each inner mixture was selected as 2." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/resource/model__hierarchical_mixture_multiple_distributions> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#modelAssumptions> "The real wind-speed distribution consists of four components" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/resource/model__hierarchical_mixture_multiple_distributions> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#modelAssumptions> "each component is approximated respectively by mixture of Weibull, Gamma, lognormal, and Rayleigh distributions." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/resource/model__hierarchical_mixture_multiple_distributions> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#modelPurpose> "Accurately model complex wind-speed frequency distributions when mixture-model components may themselves be complex." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/resource/model__hierarchical_mixture_multiple_distributions> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "hierarchical mixture of multiple distributions" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/resource/model__multi_peak_gaussian_distribution> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#MixtureDistributionModel> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/resource/model__multi_peak_gaussian_distribution> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#Model> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/resource/model__multi_peak_gaussian_distribution> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#modelName> "Multi-peak Gaussian distribution" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/resource/model__multi_peak_gaussian_distribution> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#modelDescription> "A sum of Gaussian functions fitted to the observed percentage wind-speed frequency distribution." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/resource/model__multi_peak_gaussian_distribution> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#distributionFormula> "y = f(x) = Σ(i = 1 to n) Ai exp[−(x−xi)^2/(2si^2)]" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/resource/model__multi_peak_gaussian_distribution> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#distributionParameters> "Ai" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/resource/model__multi_peak_gaussian_distribution> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#distributionParameters> "xi" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/resource/model__multi_peak_gaussian_distribution> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#distributionParameters> "si" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/resource/model__multi_peak_gaussian_distribution> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#modelPurpose> "To represent observed wind-speed distributions and compute annual energy output from the fitted distribution." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/resource/model__multi_peak_gaussian_distribution> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "multi-peak Gaussian distribution" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/resource/model__kinetic_energy_recovery> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#PhysicalModel> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/resource/model__kinetic_energy_recovery> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#Model> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/resource/model__kinetic_energy_recovery> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#modelName> "MICROSOFT EXCEL visual basic for applications (VBA) program" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/resource/model__kinetic_energy_recovery> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#modelDescription> "A VBA program developed to calculate potential gains from using a kinetic energy recovery system based on driving-cycle data, vehicle manufacturer data, and kinetic-energy-recovery-system data." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/resource/model__kinetic_energy_recovery> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#modelPurpose> "To calculate potential energy and fuel-saving gains from a kinetic energy recovery system for commuting." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/resource/model__kinetic_energy_recovery> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "MICROSOFT EXCEL visual basic for applications (VBA) program" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/resource/model__frechet_distribution> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ParametricDistributionModel> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/resource/model__frechet_distribution> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#Model> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/resource/model__frechet_distribution> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#modelName> "Frechet" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/resource/model__frechet_distribution> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#modelDescription> "Frechet distribution in the generalized extreme value family fitted to wind-speed data." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/resource/model__frechet_distribution> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#distributionParameters> "k" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/resource/model__frechet_distribution> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#distributionParameters> "c" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/resource/model__frechet_distribution> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#distributionNumberOfParameters> "2" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/resource/model__frechet_distribution> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#modelPurpose> "To compare fit with Weibull and Gumbel distributions for wind-energy-potential assessment at Debuncha." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/resource/model__frechet_distribution> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Fréchet distribution" .
