<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/resource/model__theoretical_wind_power_calculation> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#Model> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/resource/model__theoretical_wind_power_calculation> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#modelName> "TP" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/resource/model__theoretical_wind_power_calculation> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#modelDescription> "Physical equation used to calculate theoretical wind power from air density, rotor swept area, and wind speed." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/resource/model__theoretical_wind_power_calculation> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#modelAssumptions> "Air density was assumed to be 1.225 kg/m3." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/resource/model__theoretical_wind_power_calculation> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#modelPurpose> "Theoretical-power calculation." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/resource/model__theoretical_wind_power_calculation> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#physicalModelFormula> "TP = 0.5ρAv^3" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/resource/model__theoretical_wind_power_calculation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "TP" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/resource/model__parabolic_wind_turbine_power_curve> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#EmpiricalModel> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/resource/model__parabolic_wind_turbine_power_curve> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#Model> .
