<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/resource/model__parabolic_wind_turbine_power_curve> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#modelPurpose> "Simulation of wind-turbine power output and energy production." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/resource/model__parabolic_wind_turbine_power_curve> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "wind-turbine parabolic power-curve model" .
