<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/resource/model__rca4_three_member_cordex_africa_ensemble> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#modelDescription> "Ensemble constructed from the three RCMs identified as better-performing in retrospective wind-speed simulation." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/resource/model__rca4_three_member_cordex_africa_ensemble> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#modelPurpose> "To project wind-speed and wind-power-density changes across Zambia." .
