<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/resource/model__linear_scaling_bias_correction> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#modelName> "Linear scaling bias correction" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/resource/model__linear_scaling_bias_correction> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#modelDescription> "Linear scaling considers the difference between mean station data and model outputs and applies it to the outputs." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/resource/model__linear_scaling_bias_correction> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#modelPurpose> "To adjust model outputs after biases were observed." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/resource/model__linear_scaling_bias_correction> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "linear scaling bias correction" .
