<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/resource/model__piecewise_linear_wind_turbine_power_curve> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#modelPurpose> "Calculate mean power production based on a Weibull probability density function and annual energy production." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/resource/model__piecewise_linear_wind_turbine_power_curve> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "piece-wise linear power curve" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/resource/model__maximum_extractable_wind_energy_equation> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#PhysicalModel> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/resource/model__maximum_extractable_wind_energy_equation> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#Model> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/resource/model__maximum_extractable_wind_energy_equation> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#modelName> "maximum extractable wind-energy equation" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/resource/model__maximum_extractable_wind_energy_equation> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#modelDescription> "Equation expressing maximum extractable energy in the wind stream using air density, wind speed and time, with a coefficient corresponding to the Betz limit." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/resource/model__maximum_extractable_wind_energy_equation> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#modelPurpose> "Estimate maximum extractable wind energy from the wind stream." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/resource/model__maximum_extractable_wind_energy_equation> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#physicalModelFormula> "Em = 0.2965 rho v^3 t" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/resource/model__maximum_extractable_wind_energy_equation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "maximum extractable wind-energy equation" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/resource/model__wind_speed_extrapolation_relation> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#EmpiricalModel> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/resource/model__wind_speed_extrapolation_relation> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#Model> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/resource/model__wind_speed_extrapolation_relation> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#modelName> "Wind speed extrapolation equations" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/resource/model__wind_speed_extrapolation_relation> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#modelPurpose> "Estimate wind speed at wind-turbine hub heights from recorded wind-speed data." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/resource/model__wind_speed_extrapolation_relation> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#empiricalModelFormula> "v = v0(z/z0)^α" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/resource/model__wind_speed_extrapolation_relation> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#empiricalModelFormula> "kz = k0/[1 − 0.088ln(z/10)]" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/resource/model__wind_speed_extrapolation_relation> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#empiricalModelFormula> "cz = c0(z/z0)^α" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/resource/model__wind_speed_extrapolation_relation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Wind speed extrapolation equations" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/resource/model__present_value_of_costs_method> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#EmpiricalModel> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/resource/model__present_value_of_costs_method> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#Model> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/resource/model__present_value_of_costs_method> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#modelName> "PVC calculation technique" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/resource/model__present_value_of_costs_method> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#modelPurpose> "Economically evaluate the wind turbines and calculate the cost of electricity." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/resource/model__present_value_of_costs_method> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#empiricalModelFormula> "PVC = Iinv + Copm × [(1 + i)/(r − i)] × [1 − ((1 + i)/(1 + r))^t] − Sv × ((1 + i)/(1 + r))^t" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/resource/model__present_value_of_costs_method> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#empiricalModelFormula> "COE = PVC/ET" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/resource/model__present_value_of_costs_method> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "PVC calculation technique" .
