<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/resource/model__justus_mikhail_weibull_parameter_extrapolation> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#modelDescription> "An approach used to obtain Weibull parameters at a height different from the measurement height." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/resource/model__justus_mikhail_weibull_parameter_extrapolation> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#modelPurpose> "Extrapolate Weibull parameters and wind-energy potential to higher heights." .
