<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707550__conditionalfinding_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#findingStatement> "Although the Weibull, GEV, and Nak distributions provided higher accuracy for lower wind speeds, the BS distribution gave better performance at higher wind-speed ranges that fall within the operational ranges of wind turbines." .
