<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707550__conditionalfinding_002> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#findingStatement> "The paper reports that the BS distribution gives the best fits at six stations, but reports conflicting ranks for the remaining four stations." .
