<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707558__conditionalfinding_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#findingStatement> "The agreement between model average-power estimates and empirical average-power estimates depends on how well models fit wind speeds between the cut-in and cut-out values of the power curve, and this predictive capability does not necessarily correspond to models' R2 values." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707558__conditionalfinding_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#findingScope> "Average wind turbine power output estimation using the Vestas V47-666 KW power curve." .
