<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707578__conditionalfinding_003> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#findingStatement> "At lower altitudes at the Masdar Wind Station, the more flexible model MWW/LS and KE clearly show an advantage while at 50 m, all models provide equivalent fits." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707578__conditionalfinding_003> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#findingScope> "Masdar Wind Station." .
