<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707661__conditionalfinding_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#findingStatement> "The limited ability of the studied distributions to model wind speed at the Airport site is attributed to the bimodal shape of the histogram, with secondary maxima in medium intensity wind speeds." .
