<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707661__conditionalfinding_002> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#findingStatement> "For the elevated sites and regarding the fit of the probability distributions for the overall period, the Gamma distribution fit is systematically superior compared to Weibull, partly due to its ability to model more efficiently the medium and tail of the distribution." .
