<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707672__conditionalfinding_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#findingStatement> "No conventional parametric distribution can properly match the bimodal histograms because all conventional parametric distributions considered are unimodal distributions with only one single peak, whereas the non-parametric kernel estimation could fit well the bimodal probability density distributions." .
