<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707672__conditionalfinding_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#findingOutcome> "The kernel density model fit bimodal probability-density distributions better than the conventional parametric distributions considered." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707672__conditionalfinding_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#underCondition> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707672__condition_001> .
