<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707682__conditionalfinding_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#findingStatement> "For Gisenyi, the conclusion reports Gamma (p=3.44" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707682__conditionalfinding_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#findingStatement> "β=0.85), followed by lognormal (μ=1.27" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707682__conditionalfinding_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#findingStatement> "σ=0.50) and Weibull (k=1.99" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707682__conditionalfinding_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#findingStatement> "c=4.58), as the more suitable distribution functions." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707682__conditionalfinding_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#findingScope> "Gisenyi" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707682__conditionalfinding_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#reportedInStudy> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707682__study_001> .
