<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707568__dataset_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#datasetDescription> "Wind-speed data were recorded as 10-min average time series in metres per second from data loggers at 10 m, 30 m, and 40 m. The processed meteorological information included wind-speed statistics at the three heights, wind direction and its standard deviation at 30 m and 37.5 m, temperature, and humidity. A minor data gap occurred during February and March 2009 and was estimated to be less than one month." .
