<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707587__criterion_003> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#criterionRationale> "Coefficient of determination measuring fit between predicted class-interval probabilities and histogram relative frequencies, with an adjustment for the number of model parameters." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707587__criterion_003> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#criterionDirection> "benefit" .
