<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707587__criterion_006> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#criterionRationale> "The statistic compares theoretical cumulative distribution functions with empirical cumulative probability distributions and gives more weight to distribution tails than the Kolmogorov-Smirnov statistic." .
