<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707692__criterion_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#criterionRationale> "As the value of this measure becomes lower, the fit of the given distribution to sample data is improved." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707692__criterion_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#criterionDirection> "cost" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707692__criterion_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#criterionEvaluatesVariable> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707692__variable_001> .
