<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707692__criterion_003> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#criterionDirection> "cost" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707692__criterion_003> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#criterionEvaluatesVariable> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707692__variable_001> .
