<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1378020__problem_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#researchProblemStatement> "Meteorological towers are often shorter than turbine hub height, making vertical extrapolation of measured wind speed necessary and requiring careful analysis of mast and site information." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1378024__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResearchProblem> .
