<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R689577__problem_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#researchProblemStatement> "The best numerical methods for determining Weibull distribution parameters for the historical wind-speed series of Mato Grosso do Sul required evaluation." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R689596__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResearchProblem> .
