<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707402__problem_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#researchProblemStatement> "therefore, the most appropriate distribution should be selected for describing wind speed measured for a specific area to minimize errors in wind-power estimation." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707412__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResearchProblem> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707412__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ModelAccuracyGap> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707412__problem_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#researchProblemStatement> "Accurate assessment of wind-energy plant performance in urban environments is made more difficult by air movement influenced by natural or artificial obstacles, requiring better information about local anemometric characteristics." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707435__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResearchProblem> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707435__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ModelAccuracyGap> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707435__problem_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#researchProblemStatement> "The Weibull distribution is only an approximation to wind-speed statistics and may fit poorly, especially for non-circular (non-isotropic) or non-normal (non-Gaussian) wind-component distributions and for wind regimes with high percentages of null wind speeds or bimodal distributions." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707478__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResearchProblem> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707478__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResourceUnderexploration> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707478__problem_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#researchProblemStatement> "Research on wind energy in Malaysia was described by the authors as not widespread, and the spatial variation of wind-power potential required further in-depth investigation." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707507__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResearchProblem> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707507__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ModelAccuracyGap> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707507__problem_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#researchProblemStatement> "Finding the different statistical properties of wind power density is difficult, particularly when power density is derived from Gamma and Inverse Gamma wind-speed probability density functions." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707519__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResearchProblem> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707519__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#MethodSelectionUncertainty> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707519__problem_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#researchProblemStatement> "Different measurement techniques and goodness-of-fit criteria may not provide conclusive results because results can vary among methods used to select a wind-speed distribution model." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707531__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResearchProblem> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707531__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResourceUnderexploration> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707531__problem_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#researchProblemStatement> "A general unimodal statistical distribution valid for all wind regimes is not available because each site corresponds to a specific climatic condition and frequency distribution of wind speed." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707542__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResearchProblem> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707542__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ModelAccuracyGap> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707542__problem_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#researchProblemStatement> "Conventional kernel density models require selection of an appropriate bandwidth to balance bias and variance, and comparison of bandwidth-selection approaches may be required to determine an optimal bandwidth." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707550__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResearchProblem> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707550__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ModelAccuracyGap> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707550__problem_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#researchProblemStatement> "The Weibull function has limitations in some wind regimes, whereas mixture distribution functions can have greater complexity and parameter-estimation requirements" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707550__problem_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#researchProblemStatement> "a distribution with greater flexibility and precision than Weibull and lower complexity than mixture distributions would be useful." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707558__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResearchProblem> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707558__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResourceUnderexploration> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707558__problem_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#researchProblemStatement> "Previous studies showing that Weibull mixture models outperform the Weibull distribution used only a limited number of samples from confined geographic regions." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707558__problem_002> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResearchProblem> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707558__problem_002> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ModelAccuracyGap> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707558__problem_002> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#researchProblemStatement> "Goodness-of-fit measures commonly used in wind literature, including R2, do not necessarily indicate how well a model predicts wind-energy parameters." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707578__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResearchProblem> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707578__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResourceUnderexploration> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707578__problem_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#researchProblemStatement> "A relatively limited number of studies have been conducted on the assessment of probability density functions to model wind speed distributions in the Arabian Peninsula or neighboring regions, and in those cited studies only W2 or RAY had been used." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707587__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResearchProblem> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707587__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#UncertaintyProblem> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707587__problem_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#researchProblemStatement> "The selection of an appropriate probability density function to model wind-speed data is crucial in wind-power applications because it reduces wind-power-output estimation uncertainties, while the commonly used two-parameter Weibull distribution cannot represent every wind-speed regime." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707596__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResearchProblem> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707596__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResourceUnderexploration> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707596__problem_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#researchProblemStatement> "Conventional one-component probability density functions are not appropriate for wind-speed data presenting bimodal distributions, while homogeneous and heterogeneous mixture distributions remain rarely used in wind-energy assessment." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707672__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResearchProblem> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707672__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#MethodSelectionUncertainty> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707672__problem_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#researchProblemStatement> "It is difficult to select an appropriate parametric distribution because a distribution model may work well for wind speed at some wind-farm sites but may not work for others, and there is no rule for selecting a theoretical distribution." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707672__problem_002> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResearchProblem> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707672__problem_002> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ModelAccuracyGap> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707672__problem_002> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#researchProblemStatement> "Estimated parameters for an assumed distribution may not fit historical wind-speed data and may not pass statistical tests because of the extreme randomness of wind speed in time and space." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707682__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResearchProblem> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707682__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResourceUnderexploration> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707682__problem_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#researchProblemStatement> "Wind energy potential in Rwanda has not been totally exploited for power generation though potential wind power in some parts may offer possible solutions to electricity generation, water pumping and windmill." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707692__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResearchProblem> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707692__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResourceUnderexploration> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707692__problem_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#researchProblemStatement> "No study adopted heterogeneous mixture distributions for wind speed analysis in the Arabian Peninsula." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707701__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResearchProblem> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707701__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ModelAccuracyGap> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707701__problem_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#researchProblemStatement> "Wind-resource assessment commonly focuses on wind speed alone, whereas an accurate joint description of the directional and linear wind characteristics is essential at candidate sites for wind-farm development." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707709__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResearchProblem> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707709__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#MethodSelectionUncertainty> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707709__problem_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#researchProblemStatement> "The indiscriminate use of the Weibull distribution for offshore wind-speed modelling is not justified, and the most appropriate distribution should be selected for the wind climate of a specific area to minimize estimation errors in offshore wind energy." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707902__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResearchProblem> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707902__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#DataScarcity> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R707902__problem_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#researchProblemStatement> "The low number of available near-surface wind-speed measurement sites and the high spatiotemporal variability of the local wind resource limit detailed assessment of the site-specific wind resource in Southwest Germany." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R708241__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResearchProblem> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R708241__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ModelAccuracyGap> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R708241__problem_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#researchProblemStatement> "The Weibull distribution can be inadequate for modelling all wind-speed data encountered in nature, including low and high wind speed." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R708252__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResearchProblem> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R708252__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#DataScarcity> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R708252__problem_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#researchProblemStatement> "Potential offshore wind-farm sites typically have little historical wind-speed measurement and recording, creating a technical challenge for risk assessment using short historical records." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R708252__problem_002> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResearchProblem> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R708252__problem_002> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResourceUnderexploration> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R708252__problem_002> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#researchProblemStatement> "Extreme offshore wind speeds can damage wind turbines and affect wind-power-grid safety" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R708252__problem_002> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#researchProblemStatement> "therefore, extreme winds need to be estimated in addition to wind-energy potential." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R708260__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResearchProblem> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R708260__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#MethodSelectionUncertainty> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R708260__problem_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#researchProblemStatement> "The two-parameter Weibull distribution does not represent some wind regimes well, creating difficulty in selecting a suitable parametric distribution for wind-speed characteristics." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R708270__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResearchProblem> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R708270__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#MethodSelectionUncertainty> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R708270__problem_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#researchProblemStatement> "The method used to choose the appropriate distribution and optimal distribution parameters in wind energy assessment is still a difficult and challenging task." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R708294__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResearchProblem> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R708294__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ModelAccuracyGap> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R708294__problem_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#researchProblemStatement> "Accurate estimation of wind speed probability distributions is challenging for wind power planning and operation because parametric model selection is not governed by a rule, a model suitable for some wind farms may not work well for others, and conventional kernel density estimation has bandwidth-selection and boundary problems." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R708307__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResearchProblem> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R708307__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ModelAccuracyGap> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R708307__problem_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#researchProblemStatement> "Existing wind-distribution models make limiting assumptions regarding the correlativity and modality of wind distributions, and neglecting appreciable air-density variation by assuming constant air density can lead to significant errors in predicted available wind power." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R708327__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResearchProblem> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R708327__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResourceUnderexploration> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R708327__problem_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#researchProblemStatement> "A comprehensive and fair comparison of candidate wind-speed probability distributions was missing because studies often compared a new PDF only with Weibull distribution and relied on a limited number of evaluation metrics." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R708887__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResearchProblem> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R708887__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResourceUnderexploration> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R708887__problem_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#researchProblemStatement> "The diversity of conceptual frameworks, samples and results reported from previous studies makes it difficult to identify the most suitable probability density function or mixture probability density function, parameter estimation method and reliable goodness-of-fit metric for optimal empirical probability density function fitting of wind speed data." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R708911__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResearchProblem> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R708911__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResourceUnderexploration> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R708911__problem_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#researchProblemStatement> "Until today it is commonly recommended to individually select the most appropriate probability density function for each wind speed regime" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R708911__problem_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#researchProblemStatement> "none of the previous studies incorporated the best well-fitting wind speed probability density functions into a single system." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R708940__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResearchProblem> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R708940__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ModelAccuracyGap> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R708940__problem_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#researchProblemStatement> "The widely used Weibull distribution and other existing distributions may not model all wind-speed data observed in nature." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R709022__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResearchProblem> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R709022__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResourceUnderexploration> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R709022__problem_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#researchProblemStatement> "There is a lack of research on the importance of wind-data accuracy in the performance and sensitivity of wind-speed distribution models used in wind resource assessments." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R709039__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResearchProblem> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R709039__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ModelAccuracyGap> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R709039__problem_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#researchProblemStatement> "The Weibull distribution may not be adequate for modeling all wind regimes, particularly wind-speed data having greater skewness and/or kurtosis, because its skewness and kurtosis ranges are restrictive." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R709075__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResearchProblem> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R709075__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#MethodSelectionUncertainty> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R709075__problem_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#researchProblemStatement> "Reliable knowledge of the wind distribution and appropriate turbine selection based on analysis of local wind regimes is needed at different sites in South Africa." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R709086__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResearchProblem> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R709086__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ModelAccuracyGap> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R709086__problem_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#researchProblemStatement> "Accurate estimation of wind-speed distribution parameters is important for low-speed wind-energy resource assessment, while applications of metaheuristic optimization algorithms for this purpose are relatively few." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R709096__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResearchProblem> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R709096__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ModelAccuracyGap> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R709096__problem_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#researchProblemStatement> "The underlying assumption in existing mixture models is that each component is a unimodal distribution, whereas components may themselves be bimodal or multimodal under very complex wind regimes." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R709096__problem_002> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResearchProblem> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R709096__problem_002> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ModelAccuracyGap> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R709096__problem_002> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#researchProblemStatement> "It is uncertain whether a particular mixture model, specifically mixture of Weibull distributions, always outperforms other mixture distribution models for different wind regimes." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R709107__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResearchProblem> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R709107__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResourceUnderexploration> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R709107__problem_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#researchProblemStatement> "A single two-parameter Weibull distribution may not adequately represent wind-speed distributions that are bi-modal or multi-modal, affecting wind-resource analysis and annual energy output assessment." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R710275__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResearchProblem> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R710275__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ModelAccuracyGap> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R710275__problem_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#researchProblemStatement> "Lack of reliable local wind-energy information for the Far North Region of Cameroon." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R710637__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResearchProblem> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R710637__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResourceUnderexploration> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R710637__problem_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#researchProblemStatement> "No such study had so far been carried out in some other parts of Cameroon, including Abong Mbang." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R710647__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResearchProblem> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R710647__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResourceUnderexploration> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R710647__problem_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#researchProblemStatement> "At 10 m AGL, wind potential in northern Cameroon was considered unsuitable for electricity generation" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R710647__problem_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#researchProblemStatement> "highlands, hilltops and inselbergs therefore needed to be explored for potential wind-generated electricity, and no feasibility studies had been carried out on mountainous wind-farm projects in Maroua." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R711154__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResearchProblem> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R711154__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResourceUnderexploration> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R711154__problem_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#researchProblemStatement> "Studies on wind characteristics in the north region of Cameroon are limited." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R711419__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResearchProblem> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R711419__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResourceUnderexploration> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R711419__problem_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#researchProblemStatement> "Whether distributions other than the commonly used Weibull distribution, specifically Gumbel and Frechet distributions in the generalized extreme value family, can better describe wind-energy potential at Debuncha." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R711460__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResearchProblem> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R711460__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ModelAccuracyGap> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R711460__problem_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#researchProblemStatement> "There was a need for wind-speed data covering the whole Cameroonian territory and for more accurate PDFs to obtain spatially and temporally representative information on wind variability and wind-energy potential." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R711568__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResearchProblem> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R711568__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ModelAccuracyGap> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R711568__problem_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#researchProblemStatement> "The accuracy of the chosen method to estimate Weibull parameters in previous studies of Cameroonian sites was not clearly justified due to lack of such works applied to the considered sites." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R712261__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResearchProblem> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R712261__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#DataScarcity> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R712261__problem_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#researchProblemStatement> "Cameroon has very few meteorological stations, mainly located at main airports, and studies on wind power remain very limited" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R712261__problem_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#researchProblemStatement> "measured ground-level wind data were non-existent for seven selected sites." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R712275__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResearchProblem> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R712275__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#MethodSelectionUncertainty> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R712275__problem_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#researchProblemStatement> "It is crucial to precisely estimate the Weibull scale and shape parameters for a candidate site because an appropriate Weibull estimation method should provide accurate and efficient evaluation of wind energy potential." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R712552__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResearchProblem> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R712552__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResourceUnderexploration> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R712552__problem_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#researchProblemStatement> "The potential sites of wind energy generation of Turkey have not been completely investigated in detail yet." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R712555__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResearchProblem> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R712555__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResourceUnderexploration> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R712555__problem_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#researchProblemStatement> "Wind energy potential in Djibouti-city had not previously been assessed because of lack of wind data in this urban area." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R712559__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResearchProblem> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R712559__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#MethodSelectionUncertainty> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R712559__problem_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#researchProblemStatement> "No detailed analysis had been investigated in eastern African countries such as Ethiopia, Kenya, Eritrea, Somalia and Djibouti on the assessment of probability density functions to characterize wind-speed distributions" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R712559__problem_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#researchProblemStatement> "Weibull and Rayleigh distributions are not always enough and may not be suitable for modeling all wind regimes." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R712633__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResearchProblem> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R712633__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResourceUnderexploration> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R712633__problem_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#researchProblemStatement> "How will future wind speed vary at temporal and spatial scales across Zambia and what are the potential implications for wind energy generation?" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R712637__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResearchProblem> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R712637__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResourceUnderexploration> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R712637__problem_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#researchProblemStatement> "Wind energy remains unexploited in Cameroon in spite of its theoretical potential in the North of the country." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R712641__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResearchProblem> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R712641__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResourceUnderexploration> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R712641__problem_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#researchProblemStatement> "Few studies have been conducted on the temporal dynamics of production from this new wind farm." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R712644__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResearchProblem> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R712644__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResourceUnderexploration> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R712644__problem_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#researchProblemStatement> "None of the previous wind-potential studies covered the whole country, especially the Basse Casamance area in the southern part of Senegal." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R712648__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResearchProblem> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R712648__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResourceUnderexploration> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R712648__problem_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#researchProblemStatement> "Kano State has no wind power project currently due to lack of research that could reveal its potentials and benefits." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R713394__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResearchProblem> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R713394__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResourceUnderexploration> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R713394__problem_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#researchProblemStatement> "The availability of the wind resource that is necessary for exploitation is still a big limitation in Ghana, and the areas covered with wind data in Ghana by the Energy Commission are very limited." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R713398__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResearchProblem> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R713398__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ModelAccuracyGap> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R713398__problem_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#researchProblemStatement> "The absence of a reliable and accurate Senegalese Wind Atlas means that further studies assessing wind energy in Senegal are necessary." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R713401__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResearchProblem> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R713401__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ModelAccuracyGap> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R713401__problem_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#researchProblemStatement> "Electricity production in Chad depends heavily on diesel-fired thermal power plants, which lose efficiency and often break down because of a lack of renewal and maintenance." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R713405__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResearchProblem> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R713405__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResourceUnderexploration> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R713405__problem_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#researchProblemStatement> "Documentation of Weibull-parameter estimation for wind-speed data is lacking for Africa, and Nigeria has untapped wind-power potential that requires characterization." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R713411__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResearchProblem> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R713411__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResourceUnderexploration> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R713411__problem_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#researchProblemStatement> "There exists limited evidence of wind-energy assessment studies in Nigeria, where electricity supply is still below demand." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R713416__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResearchProblem> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R713416__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResourceUnderexploration> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R713416__problem_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#researchProblemStatement> "Wind energy is not extensively used for power generation in Nigeria due to over reliance on fossil fuel and hydropower, while offshore areas of southern Nigeria may contain wind resources." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R713420__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResearchProblem> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R713420__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResourceUnderexploration> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R713420__problem_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#researchProblemStatement> "Only few studies participated in the map actualization of this country by adding other sites and other parameters in the assessment of wind resources." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R713424__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResearchProblem> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R713424__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#PolicyBarrier> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R713424__problem_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#researchProblemStatement> "Extensive analyses had not been performed on the coastal Ghana wind data in order to provide energy policy makers diverse viewpoints for better informed decision making." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R713430__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResearchProblem> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R713430__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResourceUnderexploration> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R713430__problem_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#researchProblemStatement> "The onshore wind-energy resource has been fairly explored, but offshore wind energy has not been explored in the Lagos, Nigeria region." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R713440__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResearchProblem> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R713440__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResourceUnderexploration> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R713440__problem_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#researchProblemStatement> "Very little has been reported on South Africa concerning wind-distribution assessment and wind-power potential." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R713445__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResearchProblem> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R713445__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResourceUnderexploration> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R713445__problem_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#researchProblemStatement> "Lack of technical information on the availability and viability of renewable energy resources is a hindrance militating against the harvesting of wind energy in Nigeria." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R713448__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResearchProblem> .
