<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R713448__problem_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#researchProblemStatement> "There is no known research published investigating offshore wind energy potential in Benin Republic, and no data measurement is available from local meteorological offices." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R713451__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResearchProblem> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R713451__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResourceUnderexploration> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R713451__problem_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#researchProblemStatement> "The development of new wind projects in Senegal continues to be hampered by lack of knowledge of wind potential and absence of reliable and accurate wind resource data in many parts of the country." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R717710__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResearchProblem> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R717710__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResourceUnderexploration> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R717710__problem_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#researchProblemStatement> "Wind speed is a random and intermittent variable" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R717710__problem_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#researchProblemStatement> "therefore, a simple measurement is not enough to characterize the potential of a candidate wind power plant site." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R717717__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResearchProblem> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R717717__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResourceUnderexploration> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R717717__problem_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#researchProblemStatement> "Little studies have been presented in this sector in Tunisia." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R719349__problem_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#ResearchProblem> .
