<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R719349__problem_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#researchProblemStatement> "more recent wind-speed measurements and analyses across southern Nigeria are needed to provide updated information for wind-turbine application decisions." .
