<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703032__scenario_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#scenarioName> "Base LCOE assumptions" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703032__scenario_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#scenarioDescription> "Each Polaris wind turbine has a 20-year lifetime" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703032__scenario_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#scenarioDescription> "interest rate is 16%" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703032__scenario_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#scenarioDescription> "inflation rate is 4%" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703032__scenario_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#scenarioDescription> "inflation escalation rate varies from 0% to 5%" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703032__scenario_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#scenarioDescription> "operation and maintenance cost is 25% of annual turbine cost" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703032__scenario_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#scenarioDescription> "operation-and-maintenance escalation rate varies from 0% to 10%" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703032__scenario_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#scenarioDescription> "land, installation, and grid-integration initial costs are 30% of turbine cost" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703032__scenario_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#scenarioDescription> "and annual energy output is constant during useful lifetime." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703032__scenario_002> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#Scenario> .
