<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R689577__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#employsAnalysis> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R689577__analysis_001> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R689577__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#employsAnalysis> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R689577__analysis_002> .
