<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R689577__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyResearchGapIdentified> "Further studies were needed to evaluate the best methods for determining Weibull distribution parameters applied to historical wind-speed series in Mato Grosso do Sul." .
