<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R689596__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyResearchGapIdentified> "Previous comparisons indicated that the preferred Weibull-parameter estimation method may depend on the site and data, leaving open the relationship between a site's wind-speed level and the method that should be used." .
