<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R689605__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyResearchGapIdentified> "Accurate estimation of wind-speed distributions and selection of suitable methods for Weibull parameter estimation remain challenging tasks in wind-power planning and operation." .
