<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R702336__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyDomain> "wind" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R702336__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyMethodsSummary> "Three-hourly wind-speed and wind-direction measurements collected at 10 m at Mehrabad International Airport over 1995–2005 were statistically analyzed. Weibull parameters, characteristic wind speeds, wind power density, wind energy density, and wind-direction frequencies were evaluated." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R702336__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyKeyFindings> "For the years considered, yearly mean wind speeds were generally between 4 and 5 m/s, with a maximum of 4.50 m/s in 2004 and 2005." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R702336__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyKeyFindings> "The Weibull distribution agreed reasonably well with the measured wind-speed distribution in the relevant wind range." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R702336__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyKeyFindings> "The site studied was not considered suitable for large-scale wind-electric applications under the current wind-turbine technique and cost conditions, but its wind potential may be adequate for small-scale, non-grid-connected electrical and mechanical applications." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R702336__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyKeyFindings> "The highest monthly wind power density was reported for April and the lowest for August." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R702336__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyKeyFindings> "The most probable wind direction over 1995–2005 was reported as 180°, described by the authors as west winds." .
