<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R702336__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyResearchGapIdentified> "The government was reported as unable to provide 100% of Tehran's energy-consumption needs, motivating investigation of an alternative regional energy source." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R702336__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#usesEvaluationMetric> "percentage error" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R702336__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyResearchGapAddressed> "The study assessed whether wind energy could provide an alternative energy source in the Tehran region." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R702336__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyFutureWorks> "A comprehensive wind database and improved predictions should be developed prior to construction and installation of wind-energy conversion systems." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R702336__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyFutureWorks> "Future assessment and turbine selection should consider terrain, different reference heights, site circumstances, and new wind-energy generation technology." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R702336__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyLimits> "The work is described as a preliminary study." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R702336__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyLimits> "The assessment used measurements at 10 m in an open area, while terrain, other reference heights, and site circumstances should also be considered when selecting wind-energy conversion systems." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R702341__study_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#Study> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R702341__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyDomain> "wind" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R702341__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyMethodsSummary> "Twelve months of 10-minute wind measurements at 10 m height in Koronos village, northeastern Naxos Island, were statistically analysed. Wind speed and direction, availability, duration, diurnal variation and wind power density were assessed, and Weibull and Rayleigh distributions were fitted and compared using RMSE, chi-square and modelling efficiency." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R702341__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyKeyFindings> "The annual mean wind speed was approximately 7.4 m/s and the estimated annual mean wind power density was 420 W/m2." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R702341__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyKeyFindings> "The measurement site was classified by the authors as Class 7 and considered suitable for large-scale electricity generation." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R702341__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyKeyFindings> "The prevailing directions were northeastern, north–northeastern and west–southwestern." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R702341__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyKeyFindings> "For the measured dataset, the Weibull distribution represented the actual data better than the Rayleigh distribution." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R702341__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyKeyFindings> "March and July were the windiest months, with mean wind speed reaching approximately 9 m/s, while in June the mean wind speed did not exceed 6 m/s." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R702341__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#hasObjective> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R702341__objective_001> .
