<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R702341__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyResearchGapIdentified> "Only very broad information had been available on wind potential in the Aegean Sea, especially at remote locations." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R702341__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#usesEvaluationMetric> "RMSE" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R702341__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#usesEvaluationMetric> "ChiSquareStatistic" .
