<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703009__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyResearchGapIdentified> "Although several studies have investigated wind-speed characteristics and patterns across Nigeria, less attention has been given to sites in the south-east region, and the few reported studies there were limited to wind-speed distributions with less attention to wind-energy-potential evaluation." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703009__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#usesEvaluationMetric> "CapacityFactor" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703009__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyResearchGapAddressed> "The study evaluated wind energy potential at Enugu, Owerri and Onitsha and assessed selected small- to medium-size commercial wind turbines." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703009__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#assessesEnergySystem> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703009__energysystem_001> .
