<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703029__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#conductedAt> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703029__location_001> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703029__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#conductedAt> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703029__location_002> .
