<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703032__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyResearchGapIdentified> "Although wind-speed characteristics and patterns across Nigeria had been studied, the economic and performance of wind energy conversion systems in north-central Nigerian sites had not been thoroughly investigated." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703032__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyResearchGapAddressed> "The study evaluated wind-energy potential at six selected north-central Nigerian locations and performed performance and economic analyses for selected small- to medium-size commercial wind turbines." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703032__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyLimits> "The assessment used wind-speed data measured at 10 m and estimated turbine performance using Weibull distribution parameters extrapolated to turbine hub heights." .
