<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703035__study_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#Study> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703035__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyDomain> "wind" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703035__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyMethodsSummary> "The study analyzed 10-minute wind-speed measurements collected during 2007 at 10 m, 30 m, and 50 m above ground level in Zwara, Libya. A Weibull distribution was fitted using the standard deviation method to estimate wind-resource characteristics, mean wind power density, and wind energy density. Wind speeds were extrapolated to turbine hub heights using a power-law exponent function, and MATLAB was used to simulate annual net energy output and capacity factors for four selected wind turbines." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703035__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyKeyFindings> "Annual average wind speeds were 4.51, 5.86, and 6.26 m/s at 10 m, 30 m, and 50 m, respectively. Annual mean wind power densities were 113.71, 204.19, and 243.48 W/m2, respectively, and the site was classified as wind power class 2. The selected turbines produced simulated annual energy outputs from 969.12 MWh to 5155.70 MWh, with capacity factors from 21.83% to 39.80%." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703035__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#hasObjective> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703035__objective_001> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703035__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#hasObjective> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703035__objective_002> .
