<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703055__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#assessesEnergySystem> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703055__energysystem_001> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703058__study_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#Study> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703058__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyDomain> "wind" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703058__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyMethodsSummary> "Hourly mean wind-speed and wind-direction data from Bayan Lepas for January to December 2008 were analysed. Wind speeds were extrapolated to 50 m using a power law with exponent 1/7, wind-speed data were fitted with a Rayleigh distribution function, and wind power density and wind energy density were evaluated." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703058__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyKeyFindings> "The Bayan Lepas measurement site has limited wind potential and falls under Class 1 wind classification." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703058__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyKeyFindings> "The annual mean wind power density was estimated to be 24.54 W m−2 and the annual mean wind energy density was estimated to be about 17.98 kWh m−2 month−1." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703058__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyKeyFindings> "A grid-network-connected wind turbine-generator system may not be commercially viable in Penang because of the cost factor" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703058__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyKeyFindings> "small-scale wind turbine generation applications are described as still promising in the long run with wind-turbine-technology development." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703058__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyKeyFindings> "Most prevailing wind was from the N, NNE, SW and SSW directions, whereas directions contributing higher energy included SSW, SW, WSW and NE." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703058__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#hasObjective> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703058__objective_001> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703058__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#conductedAt> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703058__location_001> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703058__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#reportsCharacterization> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703058__characterization_001> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703058__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyResearchGapIdentified> "Malaysia possesses high wind-energy potential" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703058__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyResearchGapIdentified> "however, exploitation and feasibility study of clean and sustainable renewable energy are still insufficient." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703058__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#usesEvaluationMetric> "RelativePercentError" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703058__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyResearchGapAddressed> "The study assessed wind potential in Bayan Lepas, Penang Island using real-time wind data." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703058__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyFutureWorks> "Small-scale wind turbine generation applications are described as promising in the long run with the development of wind turbine technology." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703058__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyLimits> "The wind-speed data measured at 12.5 m above ground level were stated to be unsuitable for predicting wind-power potential at a higher altitude without extrapolation." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703061__study_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#Study> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703061__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyDomain> "wind" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703061__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyDomain> "sustainability" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703061__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyMethodsSummary> "The study combined experimental wind measurements at the GS mast, wind-resource analysis using Wind Rose and WAsP software, Weibull and Rayleigh probability-density analyses, and calculations of agricultural irrigation-pump demand that could be supplied using wind-farm energy subject to alternative curtailment rates and wind-farm layouts." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703061__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyKeyFindings> "The authors found that wind turbines would need to be installed near the mast on the north-east side of the mapped area because wind resources elsewhere were too low for exploitation. Under the 0.8% curtailment case, WF1 could meet 120.6 MWh of annual pump demand, equal to 18.16% of average annual pump energy consumption" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703061__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyKeyFindings> "under the 4.3% curtailment case, WF1 could meet 500.6 MWh, equal to 75.37%. Comparing system, environmental and independent-power-producer perspectives, the authors concluded that WF4, with three wind turbines, should have been the final wind farm built." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703061__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#hasObjective> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703061__objective_001> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703061__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#hasObjective> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703061__objective_002> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703061__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#hasObjective> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703061__objective_003> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703061__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#conductedAt> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703061__location_001> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703061__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#conductedAt> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703061__location_002> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703061__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#employsAnalysis> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703061__analysis_001> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703061__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#employsAnalysis> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703061__analysis_002> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703061__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#investigatesResearchProblem> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703061__problem_001> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703061__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#reportsCharacterization> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703061__characterization_001> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703061__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyResearchGapIdentified> "The paper states that there was not a study using agriculture and agricultural needs as a demand-response strategy." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703061__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyResearchGapAddressed> "The study examined agricultural flexible energy demand, especially irrigation pumping, as a demand-response strategy for wind-energy integration." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703061__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyLimits> "Data loss was significant for May and June 2009. The authors state that apparent insufficient production to meet pumping demand during these months is more a matter of missing data." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703061__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#assessesEnergySystem> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703061__energysystem_001> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703064__study_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#Study> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703064__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyDomain> "wind" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703064__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyMethodsSummary> "Hourly wind-speed data for 2000–2006 from Ankara and Polatlı were analyzed using Weibull and Rayleigh distributions. Wind power density at 10, 30, 50, and 70 m, turbine capacity factors, and energy output for selected wind turbines were calculated." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703064__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyKeyFindings> "The highest monthly mean wind speed was 6.40 m/s in July for Ankara and 5.84 m/s in August for Polatlı. The highest capacity factor was 45% for the V82-1.65 MW turbine in Ankara in January" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703064__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyKeyFindings> "the highest capacity factor in Polatlı was 37% for the same turbine in February." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703064__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#hasObjective> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703064__objective_001> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703064__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#hasObjective> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703064__objective_002> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703064__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#conductedAt> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703064__location_001> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703064__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#conductedAt> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703064__location_002> .
