<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703075__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#conductedAt> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703075__location_006> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703075__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#employsAnalysis> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703075__analysis_001> .
