<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703075__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#reportsCharacterization> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703075__characterization_002> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703075__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#usesEvaluationMetric> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R2> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703075__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyFutureWorks> "For a final decision on establishing a wind farm, detailed analysis of these sites must be investigated." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703075__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyLimits> "This study was conducted as a preliminary assessment of the wind sites." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703075__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#assessesEnergySystem> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703075__energysystem_001> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703075__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#assessesEnergySystem> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703075__energysystem_002> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703078__study_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#Study> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703078__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyDomain> "wind" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703078__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyMethodsSummary> "NASA wind data for Kribi, Douala and Limbe covering 31 years (1983–2013) were sorted into mean monthly data and fitted to a two-parameter Weibull distribution. Weibull parameters were estimated using maximum likelihood, and mean power density, maximum power density, most probable wind speed, maximum-energy-carrying wind speed, and wet- and dry-season cumulative wind-speed distributions were analysed." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703078__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyKeyFindings> "Kribi was found to be the better of the three sites for wind-farm installation in terms of monthly and seasonal variation of mean wind speed, mean power density, most probable wind speed, and maximum-energy-carrying wind speed. Average wind speeds at all three sites were relatively low compared with the cut-in wind speeds of most modern wind turbines. Wind speeds and power densities were higher in the wet season than in the dry season." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703078__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#hasObjective> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703078__objective_001> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703078__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#conductedAt> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703078__location_001> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703078__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#conductedAt> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703078__location_002> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703078__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#conductedAt> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703078__location_003> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703078__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#investigatesResearchProblem> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703078__problem_001> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703078__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#reportsCharacterization> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703078__characterization_001> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703078__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#reportsCharacterization> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703078__characterization_002> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703078__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#reportsCharacterization> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703078__characterization_003> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703078__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#usesEvaluationMetric> "P-value of Kolmogorov-Smirnov statistic" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703078__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyResearchGapAddressed> "A Weibull analysis of data over Cameroon’s coastal cities was carried out for the first time to estimate and compare power densities, maximum-energy-carrying wind speeds, and most probable wind speeds." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703078__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#assessesEnergySystem> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703078__energysystem_001> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703081__study_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#Study> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703081__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyDomain> "wind" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703081__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyMethodsSummary> "The study statistically analyzed offshore wind characteristics and wind-energy potential at Bohai Bay using one-second wind data. Weibull, Nakagami, Rician, and Rayleigh distributions were fitted using nonlinear least-squares methods and compared using RMSE and R2" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703081__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyMethodsSummary> "wind-potential indicators were also estimated." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703081__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyKeyFindings> "Wind in Bohai Bay mainly blows from the east and is mostly below 12 m/s. Weibull, Nakagami, Rician, and Rayleigh distributions performed well against observed wind speed except in August, when high null-wind occurrence reduced fitting accuracy. Nakagami performed best for forecasting wind power density according to error-sum values. Bohai Bay can be considered a wind class I region according to the study's assessment." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703081__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#hasObjective> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703081__objective_001> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703081__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#hasObjective> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703081__objective_002> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703081__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#conductedAt> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703081__location_001> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703081__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#employsAnalysis> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703081__analysis_001> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703081__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#investigatesResearchProblem> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703081__problem_001> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703081__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#reportsCharacterization> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703081__characterization_001> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703081__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyResearchGapIdentified> "Prior to this study, there had been no relevant research regarding Nakagami or Rician distributions in wind-energy resource assessment." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703081__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#usesEvaluationMetric> "RMSE" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703081__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#usesEvaluationMetric> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R2> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703081__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#usesEvaluationMetric> "RelativePercentError" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703081__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyResearchGapAddressed> "Nakagami and Rician distributions were introduced for wind-speed-distribution fitting and wind-potential assessment at Bohai Bay." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703081__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyFutureWorks> "The inaccurate fitting of observed wind speeds in August due to the high percentage of null winds will be improved in future work." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703084__study_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#Study> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703084__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyDomain> "wind" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703084__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyMethodsSummary> "The study statistically analysed ten years of wind-speed data from N’Djamena using a two-parameter Weibull distribution to assess wind characteristics, seasonal variation, prevailing wind direction, wind power density and wind energy density." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703084__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyKeyFindings> "Wind speeds were higher during the dry season from November to July and lower during the wet season from August to October. The authors concluded that the wind potential at the site is promising but adequate only for small-scale applications." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703084__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#hasObjective> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703084__objective_001> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703084__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#conductedAt> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703084__location_001> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703084__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#employsAnalysis> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703084__analysis_001> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703084__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#investigatesResearchProblem> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703084__problem_001> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703084__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#reportsCharacterization> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703084__characterization_001> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703084__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyResearchGapIdentified> "The paper states that, despite significant wind-power potential in most regions of Chad, no study had undertaken this resource for power generation up to that time." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703087__study_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#Study> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703087__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyDomain> "wind" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703087__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyMethodsSummary> "The study used the Weibull distribution method to analyse wind-speed data from Medan and determine wind-energy potential that could be converted into electrical energy." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703087__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyKeyFindings> "The average wind speed at Medan was reported as 3.159273 m/s. The authors concluded that the wind-energy potential could be used to generate small-scale electrical energy." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703087__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#hasObjective> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703087__objective_001> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703087__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#conductedAt> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703087__location_001> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703087__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#investigatesResearchProblem> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703087__problem_001> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703087__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#reportsCharacterization> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703087__characterization_001> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703087__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#reportsCharacterization> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703087__characterization_002> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703087__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#assessesEnergySystem> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703087__energysystem_001> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703091__study_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#Study> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703091__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyDomain> "wind" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703091__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyMethodsSummary> "The study used NASA MERRA-2 hourly wind-speed data at 10 m for 01/01/1990–31/12/2019, fitted Weibull distributions using the EPF method, extrapolated wind speed and Weibull parameters to heights from 10 m to 100 m, calculated wind power density, and evaluated four wind turbines." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703091__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyKeyFindings> "Over 30 years, the reported average annual wind speeds at the two sites varied randomly between 4.7 m/s and 5.4 m/s over an average period of 2 years. Wind power density and available energy were reported to be higher in Amdjarass than in Fada. The paper reports capacity factors of around 25.46% in Amdjarass and 26.33% in Fada for the Vergnet GEV MP 275/32 turbine. The conclusion recommends a \"Vergnet GEP MP 275/33\" aerogenerator, whereas the evaluated-turbine table identifies \"Vergnet GEV MP 275/32\"" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703091__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyKeyFindings> "these turbine designations are conflicting." .
