<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703095__study_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#Study> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703095__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyDomain> "wind" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703095__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyMethodsSummary> "The study analyzed wind speed and direction data measured at Ain Salah over a reported 10-year period, fitted a Weibull distribution using the standard deviation method, evaluated WGT 850 kW turbine and wind-farm energy production, and conducted a cost evaluation." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703095__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyKeyFindings> "For Ain Salah, the reported Weibull parameters at 10 m were k = 2.48 and C = 6.0 m/s, with an annual mean wind speed of 5.4 m/s. For a WGT 850 kW turbine, reported annual average power, capacity factor, and energy production were 204.12 kW, 24.01%, and 1.79 GWh, respectively. For the reported wind farm, these values were 2327.02 kW, 23.27%, and 20.38 GWh. The reported energy cost was 0.1603 USD/kWh in the text, while the table and conclusion report 0.1603 USD/KW." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703095__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#hasObjective> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703095__objective_001> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703095__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#hasObjective> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703095__objective_002> .
