<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703102__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#reportsCharacterization> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703102__characterization_030> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703102__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyResearchGapIdentified> "There is a lack of more site-specific wind resource studies which cover the different regions and topographies of Eritrea." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703102__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyResearchGapAddressed> "The study provides a comparative assessment of conventional measured wind data from 25 sites distributed over Eritrea's three topographic regions." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703102__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyFutureWorks> "More in-depth analyses should be performed before planning the erection of wind turbines at any studied site." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703102__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyFutureWorks> "The potential of AI-based forecasting could be studied in the context of increasing wind power in Eritrea." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703102__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyLimits> "Extrapolation of wind speed from 10 m measurements to 100 m using the logarithmic wind profile provides significant uncertainty because local orographic and roughness speedup effects and uneven land stability can make the profile inaccurate." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703105__study_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#Study> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703105__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyDomain> "wind" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703105__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyDomain> "policy" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703105__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyMethodsSummary> "The study analysed 11 years of daily mean wind-speed data from Akure using Weibull and Rayleigh probability distributions, Kolmogorov–Smirnov goodness-of-fit tests, wind-speed and power-density extrapolation with height, wind-turbine power-output simulation, and econometric modelling." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703105__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyKeyFindings> "The wind-speed data followed the Weibull distribution more than the Rayleigh distribution according to the reported goodness-of-fit criteria." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703105__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyKeyFindings> "Monthly mean wind speed ranged from 1.41 m/s in November 2005 to 4.24 m/s in July 1999 under the Weibull model, and from 1.40 m/s in November 2005 to 4.16 m/s in July 1999 under the Rayleigh model." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703105__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyKeyFindings> "For the combined January–December 1999–2009 period, mean wind speed was modelled as 2.71 m/s by Weibull and 2.70 m/s by Rayleigh, while mean power density was 18.51 W/m2 by Weibull and 22.26 W/m2 by Rayleigh." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703105__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyKeyFindings> "The rainy season, defined as April–October, was windier than the dry season, defined as November–March, and July was identified as the windiest month while December was the least windy month in the reported Weibull and Rayleigh model agreement." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703105__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyKeyFindings> "The selected low-wind-speed turbine simulation indicated that increasing hub height from 10 m to 110 m reduced the modelled electrical-energy cost per kWh for both distributions." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703105__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#hasObjective> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703105__objective_001> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703105__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#hasObjective> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703105__objective_002> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703105__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#hasObjective> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R703105__objective_003> .
