<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R704955__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#usesEvaluationMetric> "ChiSquareStatistic" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R704955__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#usesEvaluationMetric> "PDE" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R704973__study_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#Study> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R704973__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyDomain> "wind" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R704973__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyMethodsSummary> "Seven numerical methods were compared for estimating Weibull shape and scale parameters from wind-speed data recorded in Zuwara, Libya during 2007 at hub heights of 10 m, 30 m, and 50 m. The methods were evaluated using MAPE, MABE, RMSE, and correlation coefficient under bin widths of 1.3 m/s and 1 m/s." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R704973__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyKeyFindings> "The empirical methods of Justus and Lysen provided the highest performance when the Weibull distribution was well fitted with observed wind-speed data." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R704973__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyKeyFindings> "The maximum likelihood method gave better accuracy if the Weibull distribution was not matched well to observed wind-speed data" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R704973__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyKeyFindings> "otherwise, its accuracy was not desirable." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R704973__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyKeyFindings> "The graphical method was found to be inefficient in determining Weibull parameters, and its accuracy was affected by bin width in the cumulative frequency distribution." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R704973__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#hasObjective> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R704973__objective_001> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R704973__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#conductedAt> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R704973__location_001> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R704973__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#reportsCharacterization> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R704973__characterization_001> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R704973__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#reportsCharacterization> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R704973__characterization_002> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R704973__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#reportsCharacterization> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R704973__characterization_003> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R704973__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#usesEvaluationMetric> "MAPE" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R704973__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#usesEvaluationMetric> "MABE" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R704973__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#usesEvaluationMetric> "RMSE" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R704973__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#usesEvaluationMetric> "PearsonCorrelation" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R704994__study_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#Study> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R704994__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyDomain> "wind" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R704994__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyMethodsSummary> "The study compared graphical, empirical, energy-pattern-factor, maximum-likelihood, moment, and proposed hybrid methods for estimating the shape and scale parameters of a two-parameter Weibull distribution fitted to hourly wind-speed data at Lomé, Accra, and Cotonou. Model fit was evaluated using RMSE and R2, while predicted wind-speed mean, standard deviation, and wind-power density were assessed using relative percent error and relative root mean square error." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R704994__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyKeyFindings> "GPM did not yield acceptable adjustment errors on the three sites. MLM often had the lowest distribution-histogram adjustment error. The authors recommend Weibull parameters estimated by EMJ, EML, EPFM, MOM, and HM for predicting mean wind speed, wind-speed standard deviation, and mean wind-power density at Lomé, Accra, and Cotonou" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R704994__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyKeyFindings> "MLM is recommended for the best fit of wind-frequency-distribution histograms." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R704994__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#hasObjective> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R704994__objective_001> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R704994__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#hasObjective> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R704994__objective_002> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R704994__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#conductedAt> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R704994__location_001> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R704994__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#conductedAt> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R704994__location_002> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R704994__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#conductedAt> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R704994__location_003> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R704994__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#employsAnalysis> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R704994__analysis_001> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R704994__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#investigatesResearchProblem> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R704994__problem_001> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R704994__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#reportsCharacterization> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R704994__characterization_001> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R704994__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#reportsCharacterization> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R704994__characterization_002> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R704994__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#reportsCharacterization> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R704994__characterization_003> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R704994__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyResearchGapIdentified> "There is a lack of study in the literature on determining the most accurate Weibull parameter estimation methods to fit wind speed probability distribution histograms." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R704994__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#usesEvaluationMetric> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R704994__performance_001> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R704994__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#usesEvaluationMetric> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R704994__performance_002> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R704994__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#usesEvaluationMetric> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R704994__performance_003> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R704994__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyResearchGapAddressed> "The study evaluated numerical methods for estimating Weibull K and C parameters and identifying an appropriate method for fitting wind-speed probability-distribution histograms at three coastal West African locations." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R705081__study_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#Study> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R705081__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyDomain> "wind" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R705081__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyMethodsSummary> "The study statistically analyzed mean hourly wind-speed data recorded in 2018 at İzmir–Aliağa, Turkey" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R705081__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyMethodsSummary> "compared least-square, standard deviation–mean wind speed, maximum likelihood, and energy pattern factor methods for Weibull-parameter estimation using RMSE, R2, and Chi-square tests" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R705081__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyMethodsSummary> "and performed a present-value cost analysis for wind turbines ranging from 800 to 4200 kW." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R705081__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyKeyFindings> "The standard deviation–mean wind speed, maximum likelihood, and energy pattern factor methods produced better fitting results for the site wind-speed data than the least-square or graphical method. The annual mean wind speed was 7.53 m s−1, and the annual mean power density calculated by the Weibull distribution using parameters predicted by the standard deviation–mean wind speed method was 520.71 W m−2. The minimum unit-energy cost was obtained with the Enercon E-82 E2 turbine model." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R705081__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#hasObjective> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R705081__objective_001> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R705081__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#hasObjective> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R705081__objective_002> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R705081__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#hasObjective> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R705081__objective_003> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R705081__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#conductedAt> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R705081__location_001> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R705081__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#employsAnalysis> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R705081__analysis_001> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R705081__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#employsAnalysis> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R705081__analysis_002> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R705081__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#reportsCharacterization> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R705081__characterization_001> .
