<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R705566__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#conductedAt> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R705566__location_004> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R705566__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#conductedAt> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R705566__location_005> .
