<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R706033__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyResearchGapAddressed> "Selection of a Weibull-parameter estimation method that gives more accurate estimates at Maroua in order to reduce uncertainties related to wind-energy-output calculation from wind energy conversion systems." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R706049__study_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#Study> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R706049__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyDomain> "wind" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R706049__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyMethodsSummary> "The study statistically analysed 28-year wind-speed data measured at 10 m AGL using the Weibull probability density function. Weibull parameters were estimated using the iterative moment method and extrapolated with an empirical power-law relationship to exposed ridge-tops from 100 to 300 m AGL. Five commercial wind turbines were assessed using computed capacity factors, power outputs, energy outputs, and costs of electricity." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R706049__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyKeyFindings> "The selected ridge-tops around Kousseri and Maroua, from 100 to 300 m AGL, were assessed as suitable for wind-turbine applications." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R706049__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyKeyFindings> "YDF-1500-87 was identified as the preferred wind turbine for large communities because it showed the highest capacity factor and the lowest cost of energy among the explored turbines." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R706049__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyKeyFindings> "P-15-50 was identified as an interesting option for small communities or wind farms, with the highest capacity factor and the lowest cost of energy for its range of specific cost based on rated power." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R706049__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#hasObjective> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R706049__objective_001> .
