<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R708327__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#employsAnalysis> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R708327__analysis_001> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R708327__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#employsAnalysis> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R708327__analysis_002> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R708327__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#investigatesResearchProblem> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R708327__problem_001> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R708327__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#reportsCharacterization> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R708327__characterization_001> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R708327__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#reportsCharacterization> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R708327__characterization_002> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R708327__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#reportsCharacterization> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R708327__characterization_003> .
