<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R708940__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyResearchGapIdentified> "Widely used statistical wind-speed distributions may not model all wind-speed data observed in nature." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R708940__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#usesEvaluationMetric> "RMSE" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R708940__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#usesEvaluationMetric> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R2> .
