<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R709022__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyResearchGapAddressed> "Sensitivity of four wind-speed distribution functions to the accuracy of anemometer-measured wind data at five locations was evaluated." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R709022__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyLimits> "The analysis was based on five stations in Kerman Province and compared actual data with a rounded/truncated version of those data." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R709039__study_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#Study> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R709039__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyDomain> "wind" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R709039__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyMethodsSummary> "Hourly 2009 wind-speed data from four Turkish meteorological stations were fitted with Generalized Lindley, Power Lindley, and Weibull distributions. Maximum likelihood estimates were used for the actual wind-speed data after a Monte Carlo comparison of maximum likelihood, maximum product spacing, and least-squares estimators." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R709039__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyKeyFindings> "The Generalized Lindley distribution provided the best fitting in most cases considered according to RMSE, R2, lnL, and AIC. However, Weibull and Power Lindley distributions were more preferable than Generalized Lindley in most cases according to PDE" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R709039__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyKeyFindings> "Generalized Lindley showed substantial improvement for Bilecik in winter and Sakarya in summer." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R709039__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#hasObjective> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R709039__objective_001> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R709039__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#hasObjective> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R709039__objective_002> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R709039__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#conductedAt> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R709039__location_001> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R709039__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#conductedAt> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R709039__location_002> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R709039__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#conductedAt> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R709039__location_003> .
