<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R709039__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyResearchGapIdentified> "There is little or no literature about modeling wind-speed data by using Generalized Lindley and Power Lindley distributions together." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R709039__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#usesEvaluationMetric> "RMSE" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R709039__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#usesEvaluationMetric> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R2> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R709039__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#usesEvaluationMetric> "AIC" .
