<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R712559__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#conductedAt> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R712559__location_004> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R712559__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#conductedAt> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R712559__location_005> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R712559__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#employsAnalysis> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R712559__analysis_001> .
