<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R712559__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyFutureWorks> "The Nakagami distribution should be conducted and evaluated for more rural sites which have high wind speed." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R712559__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyLimits> "For Ghoubet, approximately 21 days of data between October and November 2015 are missing" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R712559__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyLimits> "the losses were often due to violent wind at the site." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R712626__study_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#Study> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R712626__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyDomain> "wind" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R712626__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyMethodsSummary> "Hourly wind-speed data measured at 10 m were analysed for Illizi and Es senia using Weibull statistics. Weibull shape and scale parameters were estimated using the maximum likelihood method, and mean wind speed and wind power density were calculated for monthly and seasonal analyses." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R712626__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyKeyFindings> "At 10 m, Illizi had the highest reported annual average wind speed of 6.5 m/s, while Es senia had a middle wind potential with an annual mean velocity of 3.5 m/s. For both regions, spring was reported as the windiest season. Monthly mean wind speed and mean power density were highest in June for both sites among the reported monthly values." .
