<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R713405__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyResearchGapIdentified> "Documentation of Weibull-parameter estimation for wind-speed data was reported as lacking for Africa, particularly Nigeria despite its untapped wind-power potential." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R713405__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#usesEvaluationMetric> "RMSE" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R713405__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#usesEvaluationMetric> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R2> .
