<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R713416__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyResearchGapIdentified> "Wind energy has been underutilized in Nigeria, and there was a need to investigate wind-energy potential in offshore regions of Nigeria." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R713416__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#usesEvaluationMetric> "RMSE" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R713416__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#usesEvaluationMetric> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R2> .
