<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R713420__study_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#Study> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R713420__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyDomain> "wind" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R713420__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyMethodsSummary> "The study assessed wind resources for sixteen Algerian regions using meteorological data. Wind-velocity characteristics and wind-power potential were determined using the Weibull distribution" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R713420__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyMethodsSummary> "annual and seasonal wind-resource maps were established, and wind speed and power density were evaluated at 10 m, 30 m, and 50 m heights." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R713420__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyKeyFindings> "Among the sixteen studied sites, the highest annual mean wind speed and annual mean wind power density were found in Adrar, while the lowest values were observed in Skikda." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R713420__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyKeyFindings> "Seasonal average wind velocity and temperature changed significantly from one season to another and from one site to another." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R713420__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyKeyFindings> "The dominant wind directions for the studied sites were North and West." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R713420__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyKeyFindings> "Group A regions were reported as suitable for low-power applications such as water pumping and electricity production through small turbines, whereas groups B and C were reported as suitable for high-power applications." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R713420__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#hasObjective> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R713420__objective_001> .
