<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R713445__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyResearchGapIdentified> "Lack of technical information on the availability and viability of renewable energy resources was identified as a hindrance to harvesting wind energy in Nigeria." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R713445__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#usesEvaluationMetric> "CapacityFactor" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R713445__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyResearchGapAddressed> "The study provides technical information on the feasibility and viability of wind power across wide geographical locations in Nigeria, including wind-resource potential, turbine selection, and unit electricity cost." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R713448__study_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#Study> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R713448__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyDomain> "wind" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R713448__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyMethodsSummary> "The study modeled the spatial distribution of daily offshore wind-speed data in Benin Republic's Exclusive Economic Zone using a Weibull distribution fitted by maximum likelihood. Weibull parameters were extrapolated to several heights, wind power density was computed, and bathymetric data were used to identify areas providing a compromise between exploitable wind potential and turbine foundation constraints." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R713448__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyKeyFindings> "Wind power density in Benin's EEZ was reported to vary from 129.1 to 197.3 W/m2 at 10 m, from 409.5 to 575.9 W/m2 at 50 m, from 621.4 to 850.4 W/m2 at 80 m, from 769.6 to 1039 W/m2 at 100 m, and from 924.3 to 1233.5 W/m2 at 120 m." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R713448__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyKeyFindings> "Wind resource at 50 m falls into Class 4 and reaches Class 5 close to the shore" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R713448__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyKeyFindings> "at 80 m it falls into Class 5 at some locations and reaches Class 6 close to the shore" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R713448__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyKeyFindings> "at 100 m it reaches Class 7 close to the shore." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R713448__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyKeyFindings> "The region close to the shore in Benin's EEZ represents the best compromise between wind-potential viability and foundation complexity." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R713448__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#hasObjective> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R713448__objective_001> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R713448__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#conductedAt> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R713448__location_001> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R713448__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#employsAnalysis> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R713448__analysis_001> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R713448__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#investigatesResearchProblem> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R713448__problem_001> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R713448__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyResearchGapIdentified> "There is no known published research investigating offshore wind energy potential in Benin Republic, and no wind-data measurement is available from local meteorological offices." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R713448__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyResearchGapAddressed> "The study used satellite wind-speed data to investigate exploitable offshore wind-energy potential in Benin Republic." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R713448__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyFutureWorks> "More detailed studies should be conducted to assess the techno-economic viability of offshore wind-energy projects and an offshore wind farm in Benin's EEZ." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R713448__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyLimits> "This study did not cover the economic feasibility of offshore wind energy in Benin's EEZ." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R713448__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#assessesEnergySystem> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R713448__energysystem_001> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R713451__study_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#Study> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R713451__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyDomain> "wind" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R713451__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyMethodsSummary> "Wind-speed data recorded every 10 min over one year at eight northwestern-coast Senegal sites were used to calculate monthly and annual mean wind speed and wind power density. Weibull distributions were fitted to wind-speed data, wind speeds were extrapolated to turbine hub heights using the power law method, and annual energy output and capacity factor were calculated for three large and three small commercial wind turbines." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R713451__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyKeyFindings> "Annual mean wind speed ranged from 4.32 m/s at Kayar to 4.80 m/s at Potou at 20 m, and from 4.12 m/s at Dara Andal to 4.49 m/s at Sakhor at 12 m. All assessed wind turbines had their best capacity factor at Sakhor. Repower was considered suitable for grid connection because of the quantity of output energy that could be generated, whereas Yellow-Sand was considered better for isolated application because of its high capacity factor." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R713451__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#hasObjective> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R713451__objective_001> .
