<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R713451__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyResearchGapIdentified> "In Senegal, the development of new wind projects continues to be hampered by the lack of knowledge of wind potential and the absence of reliable and accurate wind resource data in many parts of the country." .
