<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R716871__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#usesEvaluationMetric> "RMSE" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R716871__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#usesEvaluationMetric> "MBE" .
