<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R717721__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#reportsCharacterization> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R717721__characterization_001> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R717721__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#reportsCharacterization> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R717721__characterization_002> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R717721__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#reportsCharacterization> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R717721__characterization_003> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R718237__study_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#Study> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R718237__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyDomain> "wind" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R718237__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyMethodsSummary> "Hourly wind speed and wind-direction data for 2015–2018 from five Moroccan coastal sites were analysed. Weibull parameters were estimated using maximum likelihood, modified maximum likelihood, energy pattern factor, and WAsP methods" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R718237__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyMethodsSummary> "RMSE, R2, and chi-square were used to assess fitting. Wind speed and Weibull parameters were extrapolated to hub heights, wind power density was calculated, and five commercial wind turbines were evaluated using annual output energy and capacity factor." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R718237__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyKeyFindings> "Modified maximum likelihood provided the best Weibull fit for Laayoune, Boujdour, Al Hoceima, and Essaouira, whereas maximum likelihood gave the best results for Tantan. Boujdour and Essaouira recorded the highest monthly wind power densities at 50 m in July. The EWT DW52-500 had the highest reported capacity factors among the evaluated turbines, while the Mitsubishi MWT62/1.0 had the highest reported output energy." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R718237__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#hasObjective> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R718237__objective_001> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R718237__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#hasObjective> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R718237__objective_002> .
