<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R719349__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyResearchGapIdentified> "Most recent wind-profile studies focused on northern Nigeria, while more work was required to expose wind-profile characteristics of southern Nigeria using recent wind-speed databases." .
