<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R720066__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyMethodsSummary> "The study fitted Weibull and Rayleigh probability density distributions to wind-speed data from Medan for 2017–2019, evaluated the distributions using R2, Chi-square, and RMSE, and calculated wind power-density potential." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R720066__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyKeyFindings> "The paper reports that Weibull was better than Rayleigh based on Pdf comparison and R2. The paper contains conflicting qualitative claims for Chi-square and RMSE: the abstract and conclusion state that Rayleigh was better, whereas Section 3.2 states that Weibull had lower values than Rayleigh. Annual power density was reported between 72.2078 and 79.4618 W/m2." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R720066__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#hasObjective> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R720066__objective_001> .
