<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R723171__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#reportsCharacterization> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R723171__characterization_002> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R723171__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#reportsCharacterization> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R723171__characterization_003> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R723171__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#reportsCharacterization> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R723171__characterization_004> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R723171__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#reportsCharacterization> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R723171__characterization_005> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R723171__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyResearchGapIdentified> "Previous wind-resource and cost studies discussed by the authors predominantly used the two-parameter Weibull distribution at 10 m and applied individual parameter-estimation methods" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R723171__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyResearchGapIdentified> "the present study compared five numerical techniques and assessed the effect of varying hub height on cost of energy." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R723171__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#usesEvaluationMetric> "RMSE" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R723171__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#usesEvaluationMetric> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R2> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R723171__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyResearchGapAddressed> "The study compared five numerical techniques for estimating two-parameter Weibull parameters and evaluated techno-economic performance of five 25 kW pitch-controlled wind turbines at varying hub heights." .
