<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R723373__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#conductedAt> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R723373__location_003> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R723373__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#conductedAt> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R723373__location_004> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R723373__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#employsAnalysis> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R723373__analysis_001> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R723373__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#employsAnalysis> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R723373__analysis_002> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R723373__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#investigatesResearchProblem> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R723373__problem_001> .
