<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R727428__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#reportsCharacterization> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R727428__characterization_007> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R727428__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#usesEvaluationMetric> "MAPE" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R727428__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#usesEvaluationMetric> "RMSE" .
