<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R727583__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#employsAnalysis> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R727583__analysis_001> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R727583__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#investigatesResearchProblem> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R727583__problem_001> .
