<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R727587__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#conductedAt> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R727587__location_002> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R727587__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#employsAnalysis> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R727587__analysis_001> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R727587__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#investigatesResearchProblem> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R727587__problem_001> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R727587__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#reportsCharacterization> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R727587__characterization_001> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R727587__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyResearchGapIdentified> "The impact of wind-speed probability density functions on the assessment of wind-farm performance was not widely investigated." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R727587__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#usesEvaluationMetric> "RelativePercentError" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R727587__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyResearchGapAddressed> "The study investigated the influence of Weibull, Normal, and GEV distributions on expected wind-farm performance by comparing predicted outputs with actual operating data." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R727587__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyFutureWorks> "The effect of the power curve should be investigated." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R727587__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyLimits> "The present work concerns a wind farm located in a desert and hot area" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R727587__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyLimits> "the results may change for other sites with different wind regimes and climates and could be different for other types of wind turbines." .
