<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R732443__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#reportsCharacterization> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R732443__characterization_012> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R732443__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#reportsCharacterization> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R732443__characterization_013> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R732443__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyResearchGapIdentified> "No extensive study had been undertaken to assess wind-energy prospects across Chad, apart from a previous study covering only the single city of N'Djamena." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R732443__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyResearchGapAddressed> "The study provided an initial multi-station assessment of wind-energy potential and contributed toward a comprehensive wind map or wind pattern for Chad." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R732443__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyFutureWorks> "Develop a wind map for other parts of the Saharan region and locations close to Lake Chad using data recorded at various heights above ground level, to develop a wind atlas for Chad." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R732443__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyLimits> "Some stations had their last observation in late 1978 and were no longer recording wind data consistently. The study used five consecutive years of data" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R732443__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyLimits> "the authors noted that longer observation periods would provide more reliable evaluation and confidence for investors." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1557933__study_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#Study> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1557933__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyDomain> "solar radiation estimation" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1557933__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyMethodsSummary> "Evaluated five sunshine-hour and two temperature empirical models against measured monthly mean daily global solar radiation" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1557933__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyMethodsSummary> "fitted two site-specific models at Owabi." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1557933__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyKeyFindings> "The proposed sunshine-hour model had R2 0.9098 and lowest MBE -0.0102 MJ m-2 day-1 MPE 0.0585 percent and RMSE 0.0338 MJ m-2 day-1. The proposed temperature model had R2 0.8328 and RMSE 0.9859." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1557933__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyResearchGapIdentified> "Inadequate local long-term solar-radiation observations constrain Ghana solar-energy assessment." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1557933__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyResearchGapAddressed> "Calibrated and compared site-specific sunshine and temperature models for global solar radiation." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1557933__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyFutureWorks> "Use ongoing long-term measurements from other Ghana regions to improve solar-potential estimation." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1557933__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyLimits> "Sunshine-duration data came from Kumasi airport about 20 km from Owabi" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1557933__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyLimits> "coefficients and meteorological inputs are site specific." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1557946__study_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#Study> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1557946__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyDomain> "solar radiation estimation" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1557946__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyMethodsSummary> "Developed six combined empirical temperature models and a Bayesian neural network using 2006 daily GSR Tmax and Tmin" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1557946__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyMethodsSummary> "tested in summer and winter 2007 and generalized in February-July 2012." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1557946__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyKeyFindings> "Proposed model 5 was most accurate in 2012 with RMSE 1.1431 Wh/m2/day MBE 0.0255 MAE 0.8254 and MPE 1.1006%" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1557946__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyKeyFindings> "BNN generalized less well." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1557946__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyResearchGapIdentified> "Limited solar-radiation records in southern Algeria hinder solar-system design despite widely available temperature observations." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1557946__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyResearchGapAddressed> "Develop simple accurate temperature-based models for daily GSR in semi-arid Ghardaia." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1557946__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyFutureWorks> "Build larger databases to improve BNN generalization." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1557946__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyLimits> "Long-term GSR records are sparse" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1557946__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyLimits> "BNN needs a larger training database for long-term generalization." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1557954__study_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#Study> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1557954__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyDomain> "solar radiation estimation" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1557954__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyMethodsSummary> "Calibrated and evaluated 12 existing and one new daily global solar-radiation empirical model using temperature rainfall and relative humidity at six Yucatan stations." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1557954__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyKeyFindings> "New M5 was best at all stations with R2 0.620-0.706 RMSE 2.30-2.94 MJ/m2/day and MBE -0.054 to 0.303. Bristow-Campbell T2 was best among temperature-only models." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1557954__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyResearchGapIdentified> "Yucatan has sparse reliable solar-radiation records relative to temperature and precipitation observations." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1557954__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyResearchGapAddressed> "Compared meteorological-variable models and developed M5 using temperature rainfall and humidity." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1557954__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyFutureWorks> "Test and calibrate the new regression relation at additional sites." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1557954__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyLimits> "Solar-radiation sensor data have missing and erroneous readings" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1557954__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyLimits> "model coefficients require local calibration." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1560231__study_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#Study> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1560231__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyDomain> "solar radiation exergy estimation" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1560231__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyMethodsSummary> "Calculated beam and diffuse solar exergy using Petela model from monthly Indian radiation temperature and sunshine data" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1560231__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyMethodsSummary> "fitted 32 single-predictor models using clearness index and relative sunshine period and ranked them by GPI." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1560231__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyKeyFindings> "Beam exergy efficiency was 0.9286-0.9365" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1560231__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyKeyFindings> "diffuse 0.7189-0.7499" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1560231__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyKeyFindings> "global 0.7700-0.8912. Power model with clearness index for global exergy-efficiency factor ranked first overall (model 23)." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1560231__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyResearchGapIdentified> "Solar-system viability needs solar-radiation quality/exergy estimates beyond energy-only analysis." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1560231__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyResearchGapAddressed> "Developed and ranked empirical global-solar-exergy models for India." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1560231__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyFutureWorks> "Apply developed correlations to estimate solar exergy for solar-device design and performance assessment." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1560231__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyLimits> "Models are empirical correlations trained on station data" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1560231__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyLimits> "estimation depends on meteorological input availability." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1563305__study_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#Study> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1563305__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyDomain> "solar radiation estimation" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1563305__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyMethodsSummary> "Evaluated 14 existing and six proposed temperature-based empirical models using daily meteorological records from 20 humid subtropical and tropical Chinese radiation stations (1966-2015)." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1563305__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyKeyFindings> "Proposed polynomial P2 was top-ranked single-temperature model" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1563305__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyKeyFindings> "complex P3 and P5 improved accuracy by adding logarithmic precipitation and relative humidity. P2 recommended when only temperature is available." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1563305__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyResearchGapIdentified> "Reliable daily global radiation measurements are sparse while temperature precipitation and humidity are widely available." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1563305__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyResearchGapAddressed> "Developed temperature-only and complex models and ranked them with a global performance index." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1563305__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyFutureWorks> "Test and calibrate proposed relations in other humid climates." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1563305__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyLimits> "About 1.6% of observations were omitted" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1563305__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyLimits> "model coefficients require calibration and applicability beyond similar climates needs testing." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1563330__study_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#Study> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1563330__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyDomain> "solar radiation zoning and daily global-radiation estimation" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1563330__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyMethodsSummary> "Developed an optimal solar-radiation zoning criterion using k-means clustering of 1970–2017 data from 112 Chinese radiation stations" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1563330__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyMethodsSummary> "applied zoning to 1,042 surface meteorological stations, then built zone-level linear clearness-index/relative-sunshine-duration models and cross-validated against station models." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1563330__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyKeyFindings> "Relative sunshine duration was the optimal zoning criterion. Nine zones were identified, and their zone models achieved good accuracy and generalizability for regions with sunshine-duration data." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1563330__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyResearchGapIdentified> "Regions with only surface meteorological measurements lack reliable daily solar-radiation estimates" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1563330__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyResearchGapIdentified> "complex models give limited accuracy gains." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1563330__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyResearchGapAddressed> "Provided nine sunshine-duration-based zones and parsimonious zone models for China." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1563330__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyFutureWorks> "Assess changes under future climate conditions and enrich models with additional predictors." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1563330__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyLimits> "Empirical linear models use limited inputs and results depend on historical station representativeness." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1563353__study_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#Study> .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1563353__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyDomain> "solar radiation estimation" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1563353__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyMethodsSummary> "Evaluated seven empirical daily solar-radiation models at 13 Peruvian stations using 1990-2004 calibration and 2004-2010 validation data" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1563353__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyMethodsSummary> "proposed multiple-linear models added precipitation and relative humidity." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1563353__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyKeyFindings> "Proposed models reduced errors by up to 73% versus empirical-model averages" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1563353__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyKeyFindings> "best RMSE was 223.2 J/cm2/day at Tacna." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1563353__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyResearchGapIdentified> "Pyranometer data are costly and unavailable at many stations." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1563353__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyResearchGapAddressed> "Compared seven empirical models and proposed multiple-linear regressions across Peru." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1563353__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyFutureWorks> "Use proposed regression models for Peruvian solar and hydrometeorological applications." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1563353__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyLimits> "Reliable daily solar-radiation estimates are needed where pyranometer data are scarce." .
