<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1563366__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyMethodsSummary> "Compared 20 empirical GSR models using 1984–2018 data from six Fiji meteorological stations, calibrated against NASA GEOS/MERRA reanalysis and ground observations at Nadi and Laucala" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1563366__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyMethodsSummary> "evaluated with R2, RMSE, mean error and correlation coefficient." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1563366__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyKeyFindings> "Model skill varied by station and model group" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1563366__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyKeyFindings> "about 33% of sunshine-duration/radiation models and 75% of air-temperature models performed well. Best predictions generally had RMSE below 5 MJ m-2." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1563366__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyResearchGapIdentified> "Sparse, spatially variable solar-radiation observations limit renewable-energy assessment in Fiji." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1563366__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyResearchGapAddressed> "Benchmarked existing empirical models to identify suitable GSR estimators for six Fiji stations." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1563366__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyFutureWorks> "Expand long-term ground monitoring and test additional hybrid or machine-learning models." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1563366__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyLimits> "Ground observations were available at only two stations and reanalysis required bias correction." .
