<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1563832__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyDomain> "multi-step daily solar-component forecasting" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1563832__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyMethodsSummary> "Implemented multilayer perceptron and radial-basis-function models for up-to-three-step-ahead daily global and direct solar-radiation forecasting using three years of meteorological observations at URAER, Ghardaia (2014–2016)." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1563832__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyKeyFindings> "Both MLP and RBF performed well for three-step-ahead forecasts" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1563832__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyKeyFindings> "MLP showed a slight advantage in statistical metrics." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1563832__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyResearchGapIdentified> "Atmospheric changes complicate multi-step solar-component forecasts for grid management." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1563832__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyResearchGapAddressed> "Compared MLP and RBF forecasts of global and direct radiation in Saharan conditions." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1563832__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyFutureWorks> "Evaluate at more climates and longer lead times." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1563832__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyLimits> "A single semi-arid Saharan site and three-year record were used." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1563835__study_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#Study> .
