<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1563835__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyKeyFindings> "Deep-learning models produced more accurate GSR and DSR predictions than machine-learning models, while most machine-learning models trained/tested faster. RNN was best overall for GSR in Yobe (r 0.9546" .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1563835__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyKeyFindings> "RMSE/MAE 82.22/36.52 W m-2)." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1563835__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyResearchGapIdentified> "Model-selection trade-offs between prediction accuracy and computing time need systematic comparison." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1563835__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyResearchGapAddressed> "Benchmarked deep, standard machine-learning and ensemble methods for both global and diffuse radiation." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1563835__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyFutureWorks> "Test on live measurements and assess deployment trade-offs." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1563835__study_001> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#studyLimits> "Data used typical meteorological years at four Nigerian locations." .
<https://w3id.org/thirdwave/data/R1563839__study_001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/thirdwave/ontology#Study> .
